[SCANNER_RULES]

RULES1§credencial_generica§Detecta strings de 7+ caracteres§\b[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9@$#%!*?&_.\-]{6,63}\b§Low§generic_credential

R#ULES1§credencial_con_arroba§credencial con mayus+minus+digito+arroba§\b(?=[A-Za-z0-9@$#%!*?&_.\-]{7,64}\b)(?=.*[A-Z])(?=.*[a-z])(?=.*\d)(?=.*@)[A-Za-z0-9@$#%!*?&_.\-]{7,64}\b§Medium§

#RULES2§credencial_mixta§credencial con mayus+minus+digito§\b(?=[A-Za-z0-9]{7,32}\b)(?=.*[A-Z])(?=.*[a-z])(?=.*\d)[A-Za-z0-9]{7,32}\b§Medium§

#RULES3§usuario_minusculas§usuario en minusculas§\b[a-z][a-z0-9_\-]{6,15}\b§Low§

#RULES4§usuario_usr§usuario con prefijo USR§\bUSR[A-Z0-9_]{2,15}\b§Medium§

#RULES5§palabra_mayusculas§palabra en mayusculas§\b[A-Z]{7,20}\b§Low§

